{"id":1220102,"name":"엘라·심문 II","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"엘라·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1220102]}],"trial":{"trial_id":220102,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"","diary1":"엘라는 탈옥을 했고, 그녀 혼자만 도망을 쳤다.\n　　당신은 정보에 따라 그녀의 은신처를 찾아갔다.","diary2":"나인티나인이 함께 탈출하지 않았다. 이는 엘라가 진짜 도망치길 원한 게 아니란 뜻이다.\n　　일부러 정보를 흘려 당신이 쫓아올 때를 기다린 건 당신에게 그녀의 '진실'을 보여주고 싶어서 일 것이다.\n　　어쩌면, 그녀는 이미 당신을 '친구'로 인정한 걸 수도 있겠다.","evidence":[{"ID":260072,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260073,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":3,"dialogue_id":320102002,"next":[3]},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":320102024,"next":null},{"step":